Additional note
---------------
This repository's wrapper code (src/av3a_dec.c), build files and documentation
are provided by the repository author for local research use. They are not part
of the AVS reference distribution.

The reference decoder is NOT distributed under an OSI-approved open source
license. It is provided for AVS standards development, testing and promotion
only. Commercial use, patent licensing and redistribution of encoded content
require separate authorization.

model.bin is not included in this repository; obtain it from the official
AudioVivid reference package.
